    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p>Engineering Manager with 12+ years shipping enterprise SaaS and leading AI-forward teams. At Coupa Risk, manage 14 people while owning AI SDLC adoption: restructured CRA for AI-native development (tool calls −75%, tokens ~12K→~3K, query time 45–60s→10–15s), shipped 6+ production CRA Skills, and built tooling (Smart Context Builder, Presentation Generator ~80% token savings, Coupa-safe Firecrawl). Also delivered GenAI automated resolution (70–90% effort reduction at ~87% accuracy), .NET modernization, and REST/Symphony platform features. AI DLC &amp; AI Engineering Champions (Pune). AWS Certified Solutions Architect.</p>"
  },
