      "items": [
        {
          "id": "019cc743-4993-7549-b390-ab98d5c8063c",
          "hidden": false,
          "company": "Coupa Software",
          "position": "Manager, Software Engineering – Risk Platform & AI",
          "location": "Pune, IN",
          "period": "2023-06 - Present",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<p>Manager, Software Engineering in Coupa Risk (Markets 1 &amp; 3) — hands-on AI and platform leadership while managing <strong>14 people</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>CRA AI-native restructure:</strong> Redesigned CRA for AI coding tools (Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, Gemini CLI) with AGENTS.md hierarchy, universal skills, and domain context — cut AI tool calls <strong>75%</strong> (8–12 → 2–3), context tokens ~12K → ~3K, query time 45–60s → 10–15s.</li><li><strong>AI POD &amp; SDLC:</strong> Led AI POD from inception; shipped <strong>6+</strong> production CRA Skills (React UI/Figma-to-code, REST API scaffolding, RFC generation, bug triage, Smart Context Builder, release tracker) with quality gates for Skills creation.</li><li><strong>Developer tooling:</strong> Built Smart Context Builder (MCP: JIRA, Confluence, GitHub + Firecrawl); Presentation Generator CLI cutting AI token usage ~<strong>80%</strong>; led Coupa-safe Firecrawl hackathon (AGPL-3.0, n8n/CLI integrations, CCP + Okta SSO roadmap).</li><li><strong>GenAI product:</strong> Shipped production automated resolution (Python, LangChain, RAG) — SQL drafting effort down 70–90% at ~87% accuracy; scoped AI Eval Summary epic via POCs and design.</li><li><strong>Platform delivery:</strong> Led .NET upgrade and BizTalk alternative maintenance for enterprise clients (Accenture, Webster, Chubb); designed REST UDF PUT APIs, Symphony search enhancements, and UDO interactive grid/card modernization.</li><li><strong>Process automation:</strong> n8n Design Doc orchestration from Scoping Docs (hours saved for Product); Managerial Repo for manager workflows; refined release planning and capacity.</li><li>Prior releases R42–R44 at <strong>90%+ on-time</strong>; 'Road to Zero JZs' cut backlog 175+ → 99 (<strong>40%</strong>); interview loop including Sr. Manager AI/ML; mentored beyond Risk on AI practices.</li></ul>",
          "roles": []
        },
        {
          "id": "019cc743-4993-7549-b390-adc368594c1d",
          "hidden": false,
          "company": "Coupa Software",
          "position": "Lead Software Engineer – Cloud Analytics Platform",
