          "description": "<ul><li>Architected a cloud-based analytics pipeline on AWS integrating MSSQL, MySQL, and Snowflake — boosting data throughput by <strong>50%</strong> through scalable distributed architecture.</li><li>Implemented ELK-based observability stack reducing production downtime by <strong>40%</strong>; owned latency optimisation and alerting across high-traffic services — directly relevant to token cost management and AI service reliability.</li><li>Served as hands-on technical lead for code reviews, architecture decisions, and incident triage across production systems.</li><li>Improved sprint predictability by <strong>20%</strong> through Scrum maturity improvements.</li></ul>",
          "roles": []
        },
